 ],
 "notes": "Last page of Table XV Part II(A); lower part of the page is blank. First three rows (Balti, Ladakhi, Shina) complete the Skardu Tehsil block (Ladakh District) begun on leaf 264. 'Frontier Ilaqas.' is printed as a single unit with no district brace; recorded as area 'Frontier Ilaqas' under Frontier Districts. 'Gilgit District' brace with one tehsil, 'Gilgit Tehsil'. Rows in the Panjabi/Kashmiri subsidiary columns are skewed about half a row-space below their stub labels; rows were assigned by counting within each block (cross-checked against the Frontier Districts totals on leaf 263). UNREADABLE: Frontier Ilaqas, Shina, mother-tongue females printed '12,?50' - the hundreds digit is broken (only a small fragment printed); recorded null. Arithmetic does not settle it: persons minus males (24,961 - 12,511) gives 12,450, whereas the Frontier Districts total on leaf 263 (30,552 females) minus the other units' Shina females (Kargil 3,642, Skardu 1,028, Gilgit 13,412) gives 12,470 - but that total is itself misprinted (see leaf 263 notes; Part I gives 30,532, which would yield 12,450). Part I (leaf 234) gives Frontier Ilaqas Shina females 12,450. Left null as instructed; 12,450 is very probably the printed figure. Remarks column blank."
}